    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s4",
   "date": "2026-01-28",
   "url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/mediacenter/files/FOMCpresconf20260128.pdf",
   "text": "We can analyze, for example—there is some connection, it appears, between the low hiring rate for recent college grads and AI, but it’s not the main, or only, driver.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Jerome H. Powell",
    "organization_id": "federal_reserve",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source.",
    "speaker_label": "CHAIR POWELL.",
    "speaker_identity_source_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/aboutthefed/bios/board/powell.htm",
    "speaker_alias_verified_on": "2026-11-11"
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s5",
   "date": "2026-01-28",
   "url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/mediacenter/files/FOMCpresconf20260128.pdf",
   "text": "You hear large companies, though, saying—many of them saying—that they either won’t be hiring for some time, or that they’re hiring less, or that they’re laying people off, and they tend to refer to AI when they do that.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Jerome H. Powell",
    "organization_id": "federal_reserve",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source.",
    "speaker_label": "CHAIR POWELL.",
    "speaker_identity_source_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/aboutthefed/bios/board/powell.htm",
    "speaker_alias_verified_on": "2026-11-11"
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s6",
   "date": "2026-01-28",
   "url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/mediacenter/files/FOMCpresconf20260128.pdf",
   "text": "So we’re all watching and learning, and it could—it could certainly have pretty significant effects on the economy, the workforce, and our society.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Jerome H. Powell",
    "organization_id": "federal_reserve",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source.",
    "speaker_label": "CHAIR POWELL.",
    "speaker_identity_source_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/aboutthefed/bios/board/powell.htm",
    "speaker_alias_verified_on": "2026-11-11"
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s7",
   "date": "2026-01-28",
   "url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/mediacenter/files/FOMCpresconf20260128.pdf",
   "text": "We don’t really have the tools to address the concerns that may arise.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Jerome H. Powell",
    "organization_id": "federal_reserve",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source.",
    "speaker_label": "CHAIR POWELL.",
    "speaker_identity_source_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/aboutthefed/bios/board/powell.htm",
    "speaker_alias_verified_on": "2026-11-11"
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s8",
   "date": "2026-01-28",
   "url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/mediacenter/files/FOMCpresconf20260128.pdf",
   "text": "Another thing I’ll say is, when it comes to technological developments that raise potential output, some kind of technological revolution like happened in the ’90s here and like may be happening now with AI—we’re all over that.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Jerome H. Powell",
    "organization_id": "federal_reserve",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source.",
    "speaker_label": "CHAIR POWELL.",
    "speaker_identity_source_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/aboutthefed/bios/board/powell.htm",
    "speaker_alias_verified_on": "2026-11-11"
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s9",
   "date": "2025-06-18",
   "url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/mediacenter/files/FOMCpresconf20250618.pdf",
   "text": "So this is the question. The question really is, will AI be more augmenting labor or replacing labor? And I wouldn’t—I, I—we all see those announcements, including one today. I wouldn’t overread a, a couple of data points, because, you know, AI should be creating jobs at the same time. It may be replacing—it may be doing both. Anyone who’s done any work with it—with AI—will, will have been a little bit stunned at how capable it is. And it’s just a different thing. So I think this is something that certainly has transformational potential—and probably we’re in the very early stages of it.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Jerome H. Powell",
    "organization_id": "federal_reserve",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source.",
    "speaker_label": "CHAIR POWELL.",
    "speaker_identity_source_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/aboutthefed/bios/board/powell.htm",
    "speaker_alias_verified_on": "2026-11-11"
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
    "assessments": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s10",
   "date": "2025-06-18",
   "url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/mediacenter/files/FOMCpresconf20250618.pdf",
   "text": "AI could cut in a very other direction. AI could make people much more productive and—and push in the other direction. I don’t know, though.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Jerome H. Powell",
    "organization_id": "federal_reserve",
    "basis": "local_span",
    "note": "Automated extraction; exact quote and attribution span matched the retrieved source.",
    "speaker_label": "CHAIR POWELL.",
    "speaker_identity_source_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/aboutthefed/bios/board/powell.htm",
    "speaker_alias_verified_on": "2026-11-11"
   },
   "analysis": {
    "status": "pending",
    "a": {},
    "b": {},
    "topics": [],
    "confidence": {},
    "escalated": [],
    "models": {},
